# To Lead and Be Led (Q118), the sponsor's view: a character whose academy apprentice is out of the world is told so by Pinter (30298-09).
# Expectations are derived from the reference source (Q118_ToLeadAndBeLed.java onTalk, CREATED branch with getApprentice null)
# and the clan mate lines of the scenario format (#4175).
character Sponsor 40
clan 3
mate Kid 10 leader apprentice
script quest.Q118_ToLeadAndBeLed
page trainer/30298.htm
page script/quest/Q118_ToLeadAndBeLed/
npc pinter 30298 Trainer 10 0 0

action pinter
action pinter
